{"id":"n79047-1-8","stage":2,"title":"쥐 · 老鼠","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79047-1-8-1","ko":"집에 쥐가 있는 거 같아.","zh":"我觉得家里好像有老鼠。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"쥐가","meaning":"老鼠，耗子","explanation":"쥐：老鼠，耗子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쥐","audio":"/audio/a03d4ec515ccec37b6b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79047","senseId":"1","lemma":"쥐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쥐가","audio":"/audio/d8b8b9ef13e629bf8dcf.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"a03d4ec515ccec37","term":"쥐","zh":"老鼠，耗子","audio":"/audio/a03d4ec515ccec37b6b3.mp3","entryId":"79047","definition":"生活在房子附近的阴暗处，身体呈深灰色，有着长尾巴的小动物。","pronunciation":["쥐"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ae464120c993216b419.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79047-1-8-2","ko":"고양이라도 키워 볼까?","zh":"要不养只猫试试？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고양이라도","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고양이라도","audio":"/audio/0a65afc4e9f9a025e5fe.mp3"}},{"text":"키워","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키워","audio":"/audio/8f5ac951a4e1e45c2137.mp3"}},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼까","audio":"/audio/ac480717af809a867fd7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"养","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"照料动植物而使其成长。","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a67348dc0c5e13916074.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.973,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79047","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.6983,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得家里好像有老鼠。","要不养只猫试试？","你们爸爸是做什么工作的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得家里好像有老鼠。","要不养只猫试试？","你们爸爸是做什么工作的？"],"answer":1}]}
